<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities analyst Carol Pope started coverage of athletic shoe and apparel maker Nike Inc on Friday with a rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Besides dominating athletic footware, Nike is expanding its apparel business, fast becoming the largest company in active-sports apparel,&quot; she wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- She set a price target of $70 on the stock and forecast earnings per share of $2.67 in fiscal 1997, $3.10 in 1998 and $3.55 in 1999.</p>
<p>-- Nike's B shares were off 5/16 to 57-15/16.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
